<title>ZAIRE: Kinshasa radio promises Zaire rebel message.</title>
<headline>Kinshasa radio promises Zaire rebel message.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The radio station in Zaire's capital Kinshasa on Saturday said it would soon carry a message from Laurent Kabila's rebel Alliance of Democratic Forces for the Liberation of Congo-Zaire (AFDL).</p>
<p>The station is several hundred metres (yards) from the main downtown district of the city of five million.</p>
</text>
